# Generated files, marked so the tools that read this repository stop treating
# them as written code. Measured 2026-09-20: 27,480 of the 95,196 lines under
# `src/` are generated, which is 29% of everything a reader or a search pays
# for.
#
# `linguist-generated` collapses them in GitHub diffs and removes them from the
# language statistics. `-diff` goes further and suppresses the textual diff
# entirely, so it is used only where a diff was never going to be read: the
# schema snapshots, the Supabase type dump and the lockfile. The migration
# `.sql` files keep their diffs, because a new migration is exactly the thing a
# reviewer must see.
src/db/migrations/*.sql linguist-generated=true
src/db/migrations/migrations.js linguist-generated=true -diff
src/db/migrations/meta/*.json linguist-generated=true -diff
src/sync/database.types.ts linguist-generated=true -diff
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
